  "id": "50bf19af-0a49-5a60-ae1d-672202d0d469",
  "slug": "quinoa-with-chickpeas-and-tomatoes",
  "name": "Quinoa with Chickpeas and Tomatoes",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "This delicious recipe was presented to me by a vegan friend. The lime juice gives the quinoa a fresh flavor that can't be beat!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place the quinoa in a fine mesh strainer, and rinse under cold, running water until the water no longer foams. Bring the quinoa, salt, and water to a boil in a saucepan. Reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until the quinoa is tender, 20 to 25 minutes."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Once done, stir in the garbanzo beans, tomatoes, garlic, lime juice, and olive oil. Season with cumin, salt, and pepper. Sprinkle with chopped fresh parsley to serve."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 6,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 20,
  "preparation_time_minutes": 20,
